Summary of modifications:
- awx/customvars/ — new Django app for role variable extraction,
  location management, aggregated host variables, survey generation
- awx/api/urls/ — additional API routes for customvars endpoints
- awx/main/tasks/jobs.py — post_run_hook for automatic role scanning
- awx/main/tasks/receptor.py — container isolation bypass for
  docker-compose deployments
- deploy/ — docker-compose stack, Dockerfiles, configuration
